{"seq":1,"slug":"motors-drives","title":"电机与驱动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/sensors-actuators/actuators/motors-drives","wordCount":1760,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"电机与驱动\">电机与驱动</h1><p>如果说传感器让系统「看见」世界，执行器就让系统「动起来」改变世界，而电机是其中最普遍、功率覆盖最广的一类——从手表里的微型步进电机到工厂里的兆瓦级伺服。电机本身只是把电能转成机械转矩的换能器，真正决定它好不好用的是驱动与控制：怎么用半导体开关把直流母线斩成可控的交流、怎么靠<a href=\"../sensing/physical-quantity-sensing\">磁场位置传感</a>闭环、怎么让转矩平稳又高效。这一篇从电机类型讲到现代矢量控制与宽禁带驱动器，把「电机+驱动+控制」当成一个整体来理解。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>电机的共同物理是洛伦兹力/电磁感应：通电导体在磁场中受力。按励磁与换向方式，分成几个主要家族，各有控制复杂度与适用场景。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  E[直流母线] --&gt; INV[功率级 逆变器&lt;br/&gt;MOSFET/IGBT/GaN/SiC]&#10;  INV --&gt; M{电机类型}&#10;  M --&gt; DC[有刷直流&lt;br/&gt;机械换向]&#10;  M --&gt; BLDC[无刷直流/PMSM&lt;br/&gt;电子换向]&#10;  M --&gt; STEP[步进电机&lt;br/&gt;开环定位]&#10;  M --&gt; IND[异步感应&lt;br/&gt;工业动力]&#10;  POS[位置/电流传感] --&gt; CTRL[控制算法]&#10;  CTRL --&gt; INV&#10;  BLDC --&gt; POS&#10;  DC --&gt; LOAD[机械负载]&#10;  BLDC --&gt; LOAD&#10;  STEP --&gt; LOAD&#10;  IND --&gt; LOAD\">flowchart TD\n  E[直流母线] --&gt; INV[功率级 逆变器&lt;br/&gt;MOSFET/IGBT/GaN/SiC]\n  INV --&gt; M{电机类型}\n  M --&gt; DC[有刷直流&lt;br/&gt;机械换向]\n  M --&gt; BLDC[无刷直流/PMSM&lt;br/&gt;电子换向]\n  M --&gt; STEP[步进电机&lt;br/&gt;开环定位]\n  M --&gt; IND[异步感应&lt;br/&gt;工业动力]\n  POS[位置/电流传感] --&gt; CTRL[控制算法]\n  CTRL --&gt; INV\n  BLDC --&gt; POS\n  DC --&gt; LOAD[机械负载]\n  BLDC --&gt; LOAD\n  STEP --&gt; LOAD\n  IND --&gt; LOAD</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>电机类型</th>\n<th>换向方式</th>\n<th>控制复杂度</th>\n<th>强项</th>\n<th>短板</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>有刷直流</td>\n<td>机械电刷</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>控制简单、起动转矩大</td>\n<td>电刷磨损、寿命</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无刷直流/PMSM</td>\n<td>电子换向</td>\n<td>中-高</td>\n<td>高效、长寿、功率密度高</td>\n<td>需位置检测与逆变器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>步进电机</td>\n<td>分步励磁</td>\n<td>低-中</td>\n<td>开环精确定位</td>\n<td>高速失步、效率低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异步感应</td>\n<td>旋转磁场</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>坚固、廉价、无磁铁</td>\n<td>转差、低速效率差</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"从有刷到无刷-换向的电子化\">从有刷到无刷：换向的电子化</h2><p><strong>有刷直流电机</strong> 靠电刷与换向器机械地切换绕组电流方向，转速近似正比于电压、转矩近似正比于电流，用一个 H 桥就能正反转调速，控制极简。但电刷会磨损、打火、产生电磁干扰，限制了寿命与效率。</p>\n<p><strong>无刷直流（BLDC）与永磁同步电机（PMSM）</strong> 把换向搬到电子端：转子是永磁体，定子三相绕组由逆变器按转子位置依次通电产生旋转磁场。它们没有电刷，效率、寿命、功率密度全面占优，是电动车、无人机、机器人关节的主力。代价是必须知道转子位置——靠<a href=\"../sensing/physical-quantity-sensing\">霍尔传感器</a>或编码器测量，或用无传感器算法从反电动势估计。BLDC 与 PMSM 区别主要在反电动势波形（梯形 vs 正弦）与对应的控制方式。</p>\n<p><strong>步进电机</strong> 把一圈分成许多固定步距，每发一个脉冲转一步，无需位置反馈就能开环精确定位，常见于 3D 打印、相机镜头。但它在高速或过载时会「失步」，且持续供电发热、效率低。</p>\n<h2 id=\"功率级-把直流斩成可控交流\">功率级：把直流斩成可控交流</h2><p>驱动电机的核心是<strong>逆变器</strong>——一组功率开关把直流母线斩波成幅值频率可调的交流。三相逆变器用六个开关管组成三个半桥，通过 <strong>PWM（脉宽调制）</strong> 控制每相导通占空比，合成出期望的电压矢量。开关频率越高，电流纹波越小、电机噪声越低，但开关损耗越大。</p>\n<p>开关器件的选择正在被宽禁带半导体改写。传统硅 MOSFET/IGBT 之外，<strong>SiC 与 GaN</strong> 凭借更高的击穿场强（3.3–3.5 MV/cm）与禁带宽度（3.26–3.39 eV），导通损耗更低、可在数十到数百 kHz 高频开关，让逆变器更小、更高效、更凉。据 Power Electronics News 报道，EPC 已推出基于 GaN 的三相逆变板，可驱动 150 Arms 的 BLDC，面向机器人、工业自动化与轻型电动车（<a href=\"https://www.powerelectronicsnews.com/epc-launches-5-kw-gan-3-phase-inverters-for-motor-drives/\">来源</a>）。高频化也对<a href=\"electromagnetic-piezo\">电流采样</a>与栅极驱动隔离提出更高要求，呼应<a href=\"../interface/signal-conditioning\">信号调理</a>里的隔离主题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"矢量控制-让交流电机像直流一样听话\">矢量控制：让交流电机像直流一样听话</h2><p>要让 PMSM 输出平稳精确的转矩，业界标准是<strong>磁场定向控制（FOC，Field-Oriented Control）</strong>。它的核心思想是坐标变换：通过 Clarke 与 Park 变换，把随转子旋转的三相电流投影到与转子磁场对齐的旋转坐标系，分解成励磁分量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8095em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与转矩分量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>i</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9456em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。这样一来，控制 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>i</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9456em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 就直接控制转矩、控制 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8095em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 控制励磁，二者解耦，交流电机被「驯化」得像直流电机一样好控。转矩近似满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>p</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>i</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_e = \\frac{3}{2}\\,p\\,\\psi_f\\,i_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ψ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 是极对数、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\psi_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ψ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是永磁磁链。FOC 需要实时的转子位置（来自<a href=\"../sensing/physical-quantity-sensing\">磁场/编码器传感</a>）与相电流采样，再经 PI 调节器闭环。现代电机驱动芯片把电流采样、Clarke/Park、PI、SVPWM 全集成，实现「静音 FOC」——从低速到满速平稳起停、精确调速（<a href=\"https://www.edn.com/motor-drivers-advance-with-new-features/\">来源</a>）。这套闭环正是<a href=\"../systems/iot-smart-sensing\">机器人关节</a>精密运动的基础。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>控制方法</th>\n<th>转矩平稳度</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>是否需位置</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>六步换向（梯形）</td>\n<td>中（有转矩脉动）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>霍尔即可</td>\n<td>风扇、低端 BLDC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FOC（矢量）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高分辨位置</td>\n<td>伺服、EV、机器人</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开环 V/f</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>风机泵类感应电机</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"异步感应电机与开环调速\">异步感应电机与开环调速</h2><p>永磁电机之外，工业动力的另一根支柱是<strong>异步感应电机</strong>。它的定子产生旋转磁场，转子（鼠笼）被感应出电流并受力跟转，但转子转速永远略低于磁场同步速，这个差额叫<strong>转差率</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s = (n_s - n)/n_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。它无永磁体、无电刷、结构极其坚固廉价，是风机、泵、传送带的绝对主力。</p>\n<p>控制感应电机最简单的方式是<strong>变频 V/f 控制</strong>：保持电压与频率之比恒定以维持磁通，靠改变频率调速，无需位置反馈、成本低，适合风机泵类对动态响应要求不高的场合。但 V/f 在低速时转矩不足、动态差，要高性能就得用矢量控制的感应电机版本（间接磁场定向）或直接转矩控制。这与永磁电机的 FOC 共享坐标变换的思想，区别在感应电机的转子磁链需要靠模型估计而非永磁固定。</p>\n<p>值得一提的是，永磁材料（尤其稀土）价格与供应风险，正推动一部分应用回流到无磁的感应电机与磁阻电机，这是 2026 年电驱选型中一个真实的经济考量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>电机是把电能转成转矩的换能器，能不能用好取决于「驱动+控制」，而非电机本体。</li>\n<li>换向从机械（有刷直流，简单但磨损）走向电子（BLDC/PMSM，高效长寿但需位置检测），步进电机以开环精确定位见长但易失步。</li>\n<li>功率级靠三相逆变器 + PWM 把直流斩成可控交流；SiC/GaN 宽禁带器件以低损耗高频开关让驱动更小更高效。</li>\n<li>FOC 用 Clarke/Park 坐标变换把交流电机的转矩与励磁解耦，使其像直流一样可控，依赖实时位置与电流闭环。</li>\n<li>电机驱动与<a href=\"../interface/signal-conditioning\">电流采样隔离</a>、<a href=\"../sensing/physical-quantity-sensing\">位置传感</a>紧密耦合；其余执行器原理见<a href=\"electromagnetic-piezo\">电磁与压电</a>与<a href=\"hydraulic-pneumatic\">液压气动</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"电机与驱动","id":"电机与驱动"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从有刷到无刷：换向的电子化","id":"从有刷到无刷-换向的电子化"},{"level":2,"text":"功率级：把直流斩成可控交流","id":"功率级-把直流斩成可控交流"},{"level":2,"text":"矢量控制：让交流电机像直流一样听话","id":"矢量控制-让交流电机像直流一样听话"},{"level":2,"text":"异步感应电机与开环调速","id":"异步感应电机与开环调速"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"传感器接口与总线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/sensors-actuators/interface/sensor-interfaces-buses"},"next":{"title":"电磁与压电执行器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/sensors-actuators/actuators/electromagnetic-piezo"}}